### Button Hierarchy (UX)

| Priority | Variant | Use For |
|----------|---------|---------|
| 1 | Primary | Main action (Save, Submit, Nova Análise) |
| 2 | Outline | Secondary, Cancel, Back |
| 3 | Ghost | Inline, tertiary actions |
| 4 | Destructive | Delete, Remove |

One primary action per section. Right-align actions in cards/modals; left-align in toolbars.

### Card Slots

| Slot | Content | Padding |
|------|---------|---------|
| Header | Title (22px, bold) + description (14px, muted) | 28px |
| Content | Main body | 28px |
| Actions | Buttons | 24px |

