## 2. Design Tokens

### Color Tokens (design.pen → globals.css → Tailwind)

| Token | Usage | Tailwind |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `--primary` | Primary actions, brand, active nav | `bg-primary`, `text-primary` |
| `--primary-foreground` | Text on primary | `text-primary-foreground` |
| `--secondary` | Secondary surfaces | `bg-secondary` |
| `--muted` | Subtle backgrounds | `bg-muted` |
| `--muted-foreground` | Secondary text, placeholders | `text-muted-foreground` |
| `--accent` | Hover states | `bg-accent` |
| `--accent-brand` | Brand accent (blue) | `bg-accent-brand` |
| `--accent-brand-hover` | Brand accent hover state | `hover:bg-accent-brand-hover` |
| `--accent-brand-light` | Active nav background | `bg-accent-brand-light` |
| `--accent-success` | Success states | `bg-accent-success` |
| `--destructive` | Danger actions | `bg-destructive`, `text-destructive` |
| `--foreground` | Primary text | `text-foreground` |
| `--background` | Page background | `bg-background` |
| `--card` | Card surfaces | `bg-card` |
| `--border` | Borders, dividers | `border-border` |
| `--input` | Input borders | `border-input` |
| `--ring` | Focus rings | `ring-ring` |
| `--sidebar` | Sidebar background | `bg-sidebar` |
| `--sidebar-foreground` | Sidebar text | `text-sidebar-foreground` |
| `--sidebar-primary` | Sidebar brand | `text-sidebar-primary` |
| `--sidebar-border` | Sidebar divider | `border-sidebar-border` |

**Note:** Design.pen has themes (Accent, Base, Mode). Code uses Light/Dark only. `--primary` is neutral (shadcn default). Brand accent uses `--accent-brand` (blue `#2563eb`), `--accent-brand-hover` (`#1d4ed8`) for hover states, and `--accent-brand-light` (`#dbeafe`).

### Typography Scale

| Role | Size | Weight | Line Height | Tailwind |
|------|------|--------|-------------|----------|
| Card title | 22px | 700 | 1.3 | `text-[22px] font-bold leading-[1.3]` |
| Brand / Section | 16px | 700 | — | `text-base font-bold` |
| Body / Label | 14px | 500 | 1.43 | `text-sm font-medium` |
| Body | 14px | 400 | 1.43 | `text-sm` |
| Small / CTA | 13px | 600 | — | `text-[13px] font-semibold` |
| Caption / Section | 12px | 500 | 1.33 | `text-xs font-medium` |
| Caption | 12px | 400 | 1.67 | `text-xs` |
| KPI value | 32px | 600 | — | `text-[32px] font-semibold` |

**Font:** Inter (loaded via `next/font/google` in layout). Use `font-sans` or `var(--font-sans)`.

### Spacing Scale

| Value | Context | Tailwind |
|-------|---------|----------|
| 4px | Tight gaps (label + value) | `gap-1` |
| 6px | Form label + input | `gap-1.5` |
| 8px | Nav items, buttons | `gap-2`, `p-2` |
| 12px | Button groups | `gap-3` |
| 16px | Sidebar items, sections | `gap-4`, `p-4` |
| 20px | Card content | `gap-5` |
| 24px | Section spacing | `gap-6`, `p-6` |
| 28px | Card padding | `p-7` |

**Forbidden:** `p-[Xpx]`, `gap-[Xpx]`, `m-[Xpx]`, etc. Use the scale above.

### Border Radius

| Size | Value | Context | Tailwind |
|------|-------|---------|----------|
| xs | 2px | Section titles | `rounded-[2px]` |
| sm | 6px | Nav items, buttons | `rounded-md` |
| md | 8px | Buttons, inputs, KPI | `rounded-lg` |
| lg | 12px | Cards, Pro upgrade | `rounded-xl` |

Base `--radius: 0.625rem` (10px). Use `rounded-lg` for cards, `rounded-md` for buttons.

### No Shadows

Shadows are not used. Cards and surfaces use a flat pattern: `rounded-xl border border-border bg-card`. Only the page background (`bg-background`) is non-white; cards are white (`bg-card`).

