## 7. shadcn / Tailwind v4 Conventions

### shadcn / Radix

- Import from `@/components/ui/*` — Button, Card, Field, Input, Select, etc.
- Use `Field` + `FieldLabel` + `Input`/`Select` for forms
- Use `cn()` from `@/utils/style` for conditional classes
- Prefer composition over custom wrappers

### Tailwind v4

- `@import "tailwindcss"` in globals.css (no `@tailwind` directives)
- Use design tokens: `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`
- Use `@theme inline` for mapping CSS vars to Tailwind
- Fonts: utility classes in `@layer base`, not CSS vars for font stacks

